Sheoldred, the Apocalypse in B, built to Bracket 3 rules. This guide is a starting point generated from the decklist — the sections below group what the deck actually contains by what each card is there to do.

# The commander
Sheoldred, the Apocalypse :: Whenever you draw a card, you gain 2 life.

# Game Changers (3 of 3)
Opposition Agent :: You control your opponents while they're searching their libraries.
